1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,500
WOLF AI Change Gate | Should this AI change be promoted?

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:19,500
One request. Baseline and candidate. Same rubric.
Promote only when every required gate clears.

3
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:29,500
The candidate improves the planning score.
Every metric and constraint is inspectable.

4
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:41,500
Evidence stays accessible.
The evaluation receipt is a real SHA-256 digest.

5
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:54,500
Eight fixed regression cases.
Positive cases and deliberate failures-to-promote.

6
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,500
Now test a conflicting request.

7
00:00:57,500 --> 00:01:08,500
Contradictory constraints lead to HOLD,
not automatic promotion.

8
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:20,500
Request Integrity exposes hard blockers.
A higher score cannot override them.

9
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:29,500
An independent, deterministic change-gate proof of concept.
No model API, login or paid token required.
